{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_36", "source_id": "63aea0ce000000001b02500c", "title": "12月宝藏好物～心机素颜粉、一秒换手护手霜…", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63aea0ce000000001b02500c", "topic_family": "空瓶与产品复盘", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1833, "evidence_unit_count": 67, "original_evidence_unit_count": 67, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["消水肿神器、水光嘟嘟裸唇、肤若凝脂身体乳…", "Hair & Scalp Care 澳尔滨晚安粉：", "NEW 雅顿护手霜 Eight Hour", "用了头发明显看着更有质感， 是一种有营养的感觉，", "价格也是非常美好， 500ml一百出头就能买到", "不用就显的很干枯，抹起来手感也差 这是我这几年用到的最满意的护发精华", "我叫它心机作弊粉， 刚谈男朋友的宝宝准备起来"], "retained_quotes": ["不用就显的很干枯，抹起来手感也差 这是我这几年用到的最满意的护发精华", "我叫它心机作弊粉， 刚谈男朋友的宝宝准备起来"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63aea0ce000000001b02500c/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63aea0ce000000001b02500c/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63aea0ce000000001b02500c/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63aea0ce000000001b02500c/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "6a2bd522a01a2fe1ced2c36bd1b1ea6423beae128f9fd23f69cbb1d4caa62fde", "card_hash": "2fd5243f185022aa9f8baa026201c1bd1a93ffe5a96a279f16ddd316951ea6ea", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_36", "source_id": "639833fb000000001e03e545", "title": "油痘肌学会分区护理，真香！", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_639833fb000000001e03e545", "topic_family": "痘肌与痘印", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 749, "evidence_unit_count": 20, "original_evidence_unit_count": 20, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["应该很多油痘敏肌的宝宝肤质跟我是一样的，t区特别油，脸颊又薄比较容易mm，眼周还总起干纹", "2、油皮一定要学会用s，s可以让我们皮肤变细腻光滑，减少闭口痘痘的生长", "修护产品不需要分区，全脸都可以涂到 4、大油田t区，一定要注意做好深层清洁", "这是我的护肤经验，希望对大家有帮助❤️ 希望每个女生皮肤都水灵灵❤️", "这张是几年前被全女神惊叹的一张图， 她脸上那种水光感好好看 好好护肤咱们油皮也完全", "当我们油皮脸上角质层处于不薄不厚的状态，再加上皮肤微微的出油，你会惊讶的发现素颜的时候皮肤变成了那种水光肌", "而大部分男生皮会厚一些，他们用猛💊在脸颊上没问题，所以我们跟男生学护肤的时候要甄别一下相互的差异～"], "retained_quotes": ["当我们油皮脸上角质层处于不薄不厚的状态，再加上皮肤微微的出油，你会惊讶的发现素颜的时候皮肤变成了那种水光肌", "而大部分男生皮会厚一些，他们用猛💊在脸颊上没问题，所以我们跟男生学护肤的时候要甄别一下相互的差异～"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_639833fb000000001e03e545/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_639833fb000000001e03e545/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_639833fb000000001e03e545/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_639833fb000000001e03e545/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "8768c5f577e5362794200d3165796139dfbfdc1d739bf18213a1387b2346a2f5", "card_hash": "efdedf8ec5880b5f219f3da15b4572b98c6ce0cd78345bc9ce4a70946cbee3fe", "callab